  "_comment": "SiYuan: the kernel of the publisher's desktop build, one artifact per platform unpacked under siyuan/app: the Linux tarball without its top directory, the macOS disk image's SiYuan.app/Contents/Resources copied out, and the 7z archive inside the Windows NSIS installer, which the agent reads itself. Each digest is the asset's digest in GitHub's API; the publisher's own release.liuyun.io serves the same files. The Linux kernel is a static-pie ELF, so no entry names a min_version.",
